<div class="simple-card">
    <h1 class="page-title">Medication Interactions</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Review possible interactions between current medications.</p>

    <h3>Lisinopril + Potassium</h3>
    <p>This combination may increase potassium levels and should be monitored.</p>

    <hr />

    <h3>Metformin + Contrast Dye</h3>
    <p>Metformin may need extra caution around some imaging procedures with contrast.</p>

    <hr />

    <h3>Vitamin D + Calcium</h3>
    <p>These are often used together, but excessive intake may need monitoring.</p>
